{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42954","headline":"玉阶怨 · 郑鏦","name":"玉阶怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔日同飞燕，今朝似伯劳。\n情深争掷果，宠罢怨残桃。\n别殿春心断，长门夜树高。\n虽能不自悔，谁见旧衣褒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑鏦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}